<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodePushLeft</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to add a child node to a parent node, on the
    left</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">bool SilikoNodePushLeft(
    SilikoNode *object,
    SilikoNode *new_child);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodePushLeft</function> function adds
<varname>new_child</varname> to <varname>object</varname>, to the left
of any existing child nodes.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoNodePushLeft</function> returns
<literal>true</literal> if the operation was successful, or
<literal>false</literal> if the insertion failed, such as if
<varname>object</varname> is not a branch node.</para>
</refsection>
